</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A local multiplayer mode using a single mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The budget decreases after each round of shopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends when you either exceed the budget or it drops to a single digit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game commentary and streaming are welcome!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【TIPS】</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer's favorite is shown as &quot;?&quot;</strong><br>→ Every item has a hidden sub-category. It's not explicitly listed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can’t tell what the customer likes?</strong><br>→ If a white effect bursts out when selecting an item, that's their favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happens when you buy their favorite?</strong><br>→ You'll get bonus points and unlock more stage options for the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How can I increase my high score?</strong><br>→ Expand your budget or shopping cart size to boost your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why do the items slightly change the next day in Challenge Shopping?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >→ There is a certain chance that new products will be restocked or discounted.</p>", "short_description": "Shopping-Only Roguelike! Buy everything you want while staying within budget! Stockouts, price hikes, and tax increases—anything can happen! Go over budget and BOOM! No calculators allowed!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521360/header.jpg?t=1756738444", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521360/2de1006db4165a6246cc621d49bae56331b4b64b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756738444", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521360/2de1006db4165a6246cc621